# Add content specify lock (do not regress)

Anthony (2026-11-02): the specify tab only had plain OST/narration textareas; slide title sat below the fold as an optional generate-mode field, and on-screen text had no bold/italic/underline/lists.

Anthony (2026-11-03): specify could not recreate a missing process/tabs slide (Steam Cracker 4.14) because it always inserted `type: content`.

`npm test` must stay green (`src/lib/addContent.test.ts`).

## Invariants (code, not comments)

- **Slide title is on the specify tab.** [`AddContentModal`](src/components/builder/AddContentModal.tsx) `authoring === 'specify'` shows **Slide title** as the first field (same `titleHint` as generate). Do not leave specify with only OST + audio.
- **OST is the Edit Slide editor.** Specify on-screen text uses [`RichTextEditor`](src/components/player/RichTextEditor.tsx) (bold, italic, underline, bullets, numbered list, headings, color). Do not restore a plain `<textarea>` for specify OST.
- **Process / Tabs are authorable.** Specify shows Plain content, Process, and Tabs. Process/Tabs include Overview OST + Overview narration plus labeled step/tab cards (heading, OST, narration) with Add/Remove. Process includes the same **Show STEP 01, STEP 02 labels** checkbox as Course Settings / Edit Slide (`data.showProcessStepLabels`). [`buildSpecifiedSlide`](src/lib/courseSlideEdits.ts) writes `tabbed-horizontal` / `tabbed-vertical` and `data.tabs`. Do not force specify back to `type: content`.
- **Inserted slides show narration progress.** After insert, [`generateTTS`](src/hooks/useTTSGeneration.ts) records the new slide (and its tabs) so `TTSProgressToast` is visible. Do not fall back to a silent `generateSlideTTS` loop.
- **HTML is sanitized.** [`buildSpecifiedSlide`](src/lib/courseSlideEdits.ts) runs `sanitizeOstText` on intro and each tab so TipTap lists keep discs after insert. Audio narration stays a plain script box.
- **Submit ignores empty tags.** Specify `canSubmit` uses stripped OST text (`plainSpecifyText`), not raw `<p></p>` length. Process/Tabs need at least two filled steps/tabs.

## How to change this

Change the modal / `buildSpecifiedSlide` and add a failing test first. Do not “simplify” specify OST back to a textarea.
